Package: thiessen
Title: Bayesian Additive Voronoi Tessellations
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Leo", "Thomson", , "leo@feasibly.co.uk", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("The authors of the vendored Rust crates", role = "cph",
           comment = "listed in inst/AUTHORS"))
Description: Bayesian regression on a sum of Voronoi tessellations
    (AddiVortes; Stone and Gosling, 2025,
    <doi:10.1080/10618600.2024.2414104>), a variant of BART (Chipman,
    George and McCulloch, 2010, <doi:10.1214/09-AOAS285>) in which a cell
    is a region of the covariate space rather than a box. Provides the
    Gaussian, binary probit and heteroscedastic models, with methods for
    prediction, posterior intervals and summaries. The sampler is the
    'thiessen' Rust crate, built and linked from vendored sources.
